    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-09-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第9题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-09",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（23湖北事考）顾客安女士在水果店里购买了1箱苹果、3盒草莓和5盒蓝莓，共花费260元。顾客何先生在同一水果店以同样的单价购买了1箱苹果、4盒草莓和7盒蓝莓，共花费320元。那么购买1箱苹果、1盒草莓和1盒蓝莓需花费（）元。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "140"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "150"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "160"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "170"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          38
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          32
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-09-p038.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（三） · 实战精刷9 · 讲义第32页",
            "pdfPage": 38
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-09-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-09",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先设苹果、草莓、蓝莓单价为a、b、c。两次购买分别给出a+3b+5c=260、a+4b+7c=320。目标不是求出各单价，而是求a+b+c。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "a+b+c=3(a+3b+5c)-2(a+4b+7c)"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "因此费用3×260-2×320=140元，选A。展开系数分别为1、1、1，所求组合完全吻合。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所求整体能由已知组合相减得到时，不必求每个单价。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
