    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-10-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第10题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-10",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26江苏）某超市销售大，中，小三种型号的燕尾夹，小王分别购买了2只，5只，8只共花费22元；小李分别购买了3只，7只，11只，共花费31.5元。若在该超市购买上述三种型号的燕尾夹各1只，则共花费的金额是：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "6.5元"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "7元"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "7.5元"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "8元"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          39
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          33
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-10-p039.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（三） · 实战精刷10 · 讲义第33页",
            "pdfPage": 39
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-10-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-10",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先设大、中、小三种单价为a、b、c。两条已知为2a+5b+8c=22、3a+7b+11c=31.5。目标a+b+c可用第二式3倍减第一式4倍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "a+b+c=3(3a+7b+11c)-4(2a+5b+8c)=94.5-88=6.5"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "因此选A。对应系数9-8、21-20、33-32都等于1，这是整体消元成立的依据。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "用系数逐项核验等量式组合，避免只凭金额巧合凑答案。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
