      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-11-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-11",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先设春联、窗花、小狗玩偶单价为a、b、c。已知7a+12b+5c=200，9a+19b+5c=224。目标是10a+10b+10c。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "10a+10b+10c=4(7a+12b+5c)-2(9a+19b+5c)"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以费用4×200-2×224=800-448=352元，选D。展开检查28-18=10、48-38=10、20-10=10，三种数量全部对应。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "整体消元中的倍数要同时匹配全部商品数量。"
        }
      ],
