    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-12-explanation-02",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析 · 2",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-12",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "服务总时间相等先列旧新工作量关系，最后将比值转换到题目问的时点。"
        }
      ],
